  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance - United States-Indo-Pacific Standards and Technology Cooperation Program Technical Assistance, through American National Standards Institute</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USTDA funding is supporting the U.S.-Indo-Pacific Standards and Technology Cooperation Program (STCP), a series of 12 separate and distinct standards-focused workshops to be held in different countries throughout the Indo-Pacific region. The STCP is designed to support the Indo-Pacific Strategy by facilitating engagement between U.S. and Indo-Pacific industry and government representatives to ensure that decision-makers who develop and implement standards, testing protocols, and regulatory procedures in the region are informed of internationally accepted industry-led standards.</narrative>
  </description>
